":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329781816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110745#issuecomment-3329781816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110745","id":3329781816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GeHA4","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T16:29:37Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T16:31:31Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108780.\n\nThe Core 2 Duo/Quad series doesn't have SSE4.2 support, but only SSE2 support. Godot 4.5 onwards requires SSE4.2 in its 64-bit binaries (which improves performance). That said, you can still run the 32-bit version of Godot as its requirement is still only SSE2, even after 4.5. (Note that on Linux, you will have to install some 32-bit libraries to be able to run it.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3329781816/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]